      <h1 class="article-title">The Heidelberg Catechism</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">1563</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">129 questions and answers for the Christian life, organized into 52 Lord’s Days.</p>
      
      
      <div class="faith-doc-actions">
        
